    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "im just so tired of the \"healing\" talk. it feels like a lie. like, you can't just heal from losing your entire life and being a joke to everyone you know. it's not some wound that closes up, it's just... it's a permanent stain. i feel like i'm just waiting for the impact.",
